---

<!-- ── Cómo trabajamos ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 pb-2 pt-4">
  <span class="kz-eyebrow">{es ? 'Cómo trabajamos' : 'How we work'}</span>
  <h2 class="kz-h2 mt-2" style="font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 32px)">
    {es ? 'Cuatro pasos, y el precio antes del taladro' : 'Four steps, and the price before the drill'}
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-[720px] text-[16px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink2); text-wrap: pretty">
    {es
      ? 'Ninguna instalación empieza con una cotización por teléfono. Empieza con alguien parado en tu portón viendo por dónde entra la gente.'
      : 'No installation starts with a quote over the phone. It starts with someone standing at your gate, seeing where people come in.'}
  </p>

  <ol class="kz-proceso mt-8">
    {proceso.map((p, i) => (
      <li class="kz-paso">
        <span class="kz-paso-n" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</span>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <strong class="text-[16px] font-bold">{es ? p.tEs : p.tEn}</strong>
          <span class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink2)">{es ? p.dEs : p.dEn}</span>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-medium" style="color: var(--green2)">{es ? p.nEs : p.nEn}</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>

<!-- ── Tipos de cámara ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="border-y mt-16" style="background: var(--bg2); border-color: var(--line)">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 py-16">
    <span class="kz-eyebrow">{es ? 'Catálogo técnico' : 'Technical catalog'}</span>
    <h2 class="kz-h2 mt-2" style="font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 32px)">
      {es ? 'Cada cámara resuelve un problema distinto' : 'Each camera solves a different problem'}
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-[720px] text-[16px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink2); text-wrap: pretty">
      {es
        ? 'La cámara equivocada en el lugar equivocado explica casi todos los casos de "tengo cámaras, pero no se reconoce a nadie". Esto es lo que instalamos y para qué sirve cada tipo.'
        : 'The wrong camera in the wrong place explains nearly every case of "I have cameras, but nobody is recognizable". This is what we install and what each type is for.'}
    </p>

    <ul class="mt-8 grid list-none gap-4" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr))">
      {tipos.map((t) => (
        <li class="kz-card flex flex-col gap-3 p-6">
          <span class="kz-illo" aria-hidden="true">
            {t.id === 'bala' && (
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="20" y="18" width="46" height="20" rx="10" />
                <path d="M66 22h8a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-8" />
                <circle cx="70" cy="28" r="3.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" opacity=".55" />
                <path d="M34 38v8M34 46h-8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v4" />
                <path d="M18 54h16" />
                <path d="M78 20c5 5 5 17 0 22" opacity=".45" />
                <path d="M85 15c8 8 8 27 0 35" opacity=".25" />
              </svg>
            )}
            {t.id === 'domo' && (
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M22 14h52" />
                <path d="M30 40a18 18 0 0 1 36 0z" />
                <path d="M30 40h36" />
                <path d="M48 22v-8" />
                <circle cx="48" cy="33" r="5" />
                <path d="M34 48c4 6 24 6 28 0" opacity=".35" />
              </svg>
            )}
            {t.id === 'ptz' && (
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M30 14h36" />
                <path d="M48 14v6" />
                <rect x="34" y="20" width="28" height="9" rx="4" />
                <circle cx="48" cy="42" r="13" />
                <circle cx="48" cy="42" r="5" />
                <path d="M22 42a8 8 0 0 1 4-7" opacity=".45" />
                <path d="M74 42a8 8 0 0 0-4-7" opacity=".45" />
                <path d="M26 54c6 5 38 5 44 0" opacity=".3" />
              </svg>
            )}
            {t.id === 'ip' && (
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="26" y="20" width="36" height="26" rx="6" />
                <circle cx="44" cy="33" r="7" />
                <circle cx="44" cy="33" r="2.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
                <path d="M62 30h6l6-5v16l-6-5h-6" />
                <path d="M34 46v8h20v-8" opacity=".5" />
                <path d="M20 26c-3 4-3 10 0 14" opacity=".4" />
                <path d="M14 21c-5 7-5 15 0 22" opacity=".22" />
              </svg>
            )}
            {t.id === 'panoramica' && (
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M26 16h44" />
                <circle cx="48" cy="34" r="12" />
                <circle cx="48" cy="34" r="4.5" />
                <path d="M48 22v-6" />
                <path d="M16 50c8-14 56-14 64 0" opacity=".4" />
                <path d="M10 56c10-19 66-19 76 0" opacity=".2" />
              </svg>
            )}
            {t.id === 'termica' && (
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="30" y="24" width="36" height="18" rx="6" />
                <circle cx="48" cy="33" r="5.5" />
                <path d="M30 20h36" />
                <path d="M24 16l-6-5M72 16l6-5" opacity=".5" />
                <path d="M38 48v6M58 48v6" opacity=".45" />
                <path d="M18 34h-8M86 34h-8" opacity=".45" />
                <path d="M26 44c-4 4-6 9-6 12M70 44c4 4 6 9 6 12" opacity=".25" />
              </svg>
            )}
          </span>
          <strong class="text-[17px] font-bold" style="letter-spacing: -0.01em">{es ? t.tEs : t.tEn}</strong>
          <span class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink2)">{es ? t.pEs : t.pEn}</span>
          <span class="kz-donde">
            <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.07em]" style="color: var(--mute)">
              {es ? 'Dónde se instala' : 'Where it goes'}
            </span>
            <span class="text-[13px]" style="color: var(--ink2)">{es ? t.dEs : t.dEn}</span>
          </span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <!-- La columna de limitaciones es la que hace creíbles a las otras tres. -->
    <h3 class="mt-12 text-[18px] font-bold">
      {es ? 'Comparación, con las limitaciones incluidas' : 'Comparison, limitations included'}
    </h3>
    <div class="kz-tabla mt-4">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>{es ? 'Tipo' : 'Type'}</th>
            <th>{es ? 'Mejor para' : 'Best for'}</th>
            <th>{es ? 'Alcance útil' : 'Usable range'}</th>
            <th>{es ? 'Lo que no hace' : 'What it does not do'}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {comparativa.map((c) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="kz-td-tipo">{es ? c.tEs : c.tEn}</td>
              <td>{es ? c.mEs : c.mEn}</td>
              <td class="kz-td-num">{es ? c.aEs : c.aEn}</td>
              <td style="color: var(--ink2)">{es ? c.lEs : c.lEn}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[13px]" style="color: var(--mute)">
      {es
        ? 'El alcance es orientativo: depende del lente, de la luz disponible y de la altura de montaje. En la visita lo medimos en tu lugar.'
        : 'Ranges are indicative: they depend on the lens, the available light and the mounting height. We measure it at your place during the visit.'}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── El sistema completo ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 py-16">
  <span class="kz-eyebrow">{es ? 'La instalación completa' : 'The complete installation'}</span>
  <h2 class="kz-h2 mt-2" style="font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 32px)">
    {es ? 'Las cámaras son la mitad visible del sistema' : 'The cameras are the visible half of the system'}
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-[720px] text-[16px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink2); text-wrap: pretty">
    {es
      ? 'La otra mitad decide si el video sirve como prueba: el grabador, el disco, la alimentación y el cable. Es donde se recorta un presupuesto barato, y es lo primero que falla.'
      : 'The other half decides whether the footage holds up as evidence: the recorder, the drive, the power and the cable. It is where a cheap budget cuts corners, and the first thing to fail.'}
  </p>

  <div class="kz-diagrama mt-8">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 980 300" role="img" aria-label={es ? 'Diagrama: las cámaras llegan por cable al switch PoE y al grabador en el rack, y el video sale por internet a tu celular' : 'Diagram: cameras run by cable to the PoE switch and the recorder in the rack, and video goes over the internet to your phone'}>
      <g class="kz-dg-cam">
        <rect x="24" y="36" width="66" height="26" rx="13" />
        <path d="M48 62v14" />
        <rect x="24" y="126" width="66" height="26" rx="13" />
        <path d="M48 152v14" />
        <rect x="24" y="216" width="66" height="26" rx="13" />
        <path d="M48 216v-14" />
      </g>
      <text x="57" y="26" class="kz-dg-rot">{es ? 'Bala · portón' : 'Bullet · gate'}</text>
      <text x="57" y="116" class="kz-dg-rot">{es ? 'Domo · caja' : 'Dome · register'}</text>
      <text x="57" y="262" class="kz-dg-rot">{es ? 'PTZ · patio' : 'PTZ · yard'}</text>

